---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import Faq from '../components/Faq.astro';
import ApplyButton from '../components/ApplyButton.astro';
// SEO title, description and FAQs for this page are edited in the admin (content/special/china-business-visa.json).
import content from '../../content/special/china-business-visa.json';
const title = content.title;
const description = content.description;
const schemas = [];
---
<Page title={title} description={description} schemas={schemas}>
<main>
<div class="page-head">
<div class="wrap">
<nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/worldwide-visas/">Worldwide Visas</a></nav>
<h1>China business visa (M visa)</h1>
<p class="lead">The China business visa (M visa) is for commercial trips such as meetings, trade fairs, factory and supplier visits, and negotiating contracts. British passport holders can currently make short business trips visa-free, so you need an M visa if your stay is longer, you need multiple entries over a longer period, or you travel on another passport.</p>
<ApplyButton url={content.applyButton} /></div></div>
<div class="wrap section page-body" style="padding-top:64px">
<div class="content">
<section>
<h2>Do you qualify?</h2>
<ul>
<li>Your trip is for business activities, not paid work in China</li>
<li>You have an invitation from a company or trade fair organiser in China</li>
<li>Your passport is valid for at least six months, with blank visa pages</li>
<li>If you are not British, you hold valid UK residence status</li></ul></section>
<section>
<h2>Documents you&#x27;ll need</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table class="data-table"><thead>
<tr><th scope="col">Document</th><th scope="col">Details</th><th scope="col">Needed</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th scope="row" data-label="Document">Passport</th><td data-label="Details">Original passport valid for at least six months, with two blank visa pages, plus a copy of the photo page</td><td data-label="Needed"><span class="tag tag-req">Required</span></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" data-label="Document">Application form</th><td data-label="Details">Completed online, printed and signed. We prepare this for you</td><td data-label="Needed"><span class="tag tag-us">We prepare</span></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" data-label="Document">Photo</th><td data-label="Details">Recent colour photo on a white background, meeting Chinese visa specifications</td><td data-label="Needed"><span class="tag tag-req">Required</span></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" data-label="Document">Invitation letter</th><td data-label="Details">From the Chinese company or trade fair, showing their details, your details, the purpose and dates of the trip, and who is paying</td><td data-label="Needed"><span class="tag tag-req">Required</span></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" data-label="Document">UK residence evidence</th><td data-label="Details">Your UK visa, BRP or eVisa share code</td><td data-label="Needed"><span class="tag tag-opt">If not British</span></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" data-label="Document">Previous Chinese visas</th><td data-label="Details">Copies of any Chinese visas you have held before</td><td data-label="Needed"><span class="tag tag-opt">If applicable</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="soft" style="font-size:15px">We give you a full checklist for your circumstances at your consultation.</p></section>
<section>
<h2>How we help</h2>
<ul>
<li>Check your eligibility and confirm the right route at your consultation</li>
<li>Give you a personalised document checklist</li>
<li>Prepare and complete your application forms</li>
<li>Review all evidence against the current rules before submission</li>
<li>Keep you updated until you have a decision</li></ul></section>
<section id="fees">
<h2>Fees and timescales</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table class="data-table price-table"><thead>
<tr><th scope="col">Service</th><th scope="col">What&#x27;s included</th><th scope="col">Processing</th><th scope="col">Our fee</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th scope="row" data-label="Service">Standard</th><td data-label="What&#x27;s included">Form completion, document check, visa centre appointment and submission support</td><td data-label="Processing">[X] working days</td><td data-label="Our fee" class="price">£[XX]</td></tr>
<tr class="popular"><th scope="row" data-label="Service">Express<span class="tag tag-pop">Most popular</span></th><td data-label="What&#x27;s included">Everything in Standard, with faster processing at the visa centre</td><td data-label="Processing">[X] working days</td><td data-label="Our fee" class="price">£[XX]</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row" data-label="Service">Urgent</th><td data-label="What&#x27;s included">Everything in Standard, with the fastest processing available</td><td data-label="Processing">[X] working day</td><td data-label="Our fee" class="price">£[XX]</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="soft" style="font-size:15px">Our fee covers our service. The Chinese visa fee and visa centre service fee are paid separately at cost, and depend on your nationality and the number of entries.</p>
<div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact-us/">Start your application</a></div></section>

<Faq items={content.faqs} title={content.faqHeading} />

<section>
<h2>Related services</h2>
<ul>
<li><a href="/china-visa-application/">China visa from the UK</a></li>
<li><a href="/china-work-visa-for-uk-citizens/">China work visa (Z visa)</a></li></ul></section></div>
<aside class="aside">
<div class="panel">
<h2>Talk to an adviser</h2>
<p class="soft" style="font-size:16px">Book a consultation and we&#x27;ll confirm your options, what you&#x27;ll need and our fee.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact-us/">Book a consultation</a><a href="tel:+441619562003" class="btn btn-outline">Call 0161 956 2003</a>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-mute)">IAA-regulated · Ref F200700144</p></div></aside></div>
<section class="wrap section">
<div class="cta-band">
<div class="stack" style="flex:1 1 460px;min-width:0;gap:10px">
<h2>Not sure which visa you need?</h2>
<p>Book a consultation and we&#x27;ll tell you your options, what you&#x27;ll need and what it will cost.</p></div>
<div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/contact-us/">Book a consultation</a><a href="tel:+441619562003" class="btn btn-ghost-light">0161 956 2003</a></div></div></section></main>
</Page>
